@@ -2,6 +2,24 @@

 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication
+
+Every request carries `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are in the data as
+`apiKeys: [{ key, name, role }]`. Roles:
+
+- `viewer`: reads (GET) only.
+- `cook`: also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+  `POST /temperatures` and `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: everything, including `GET /audit`.
+
+A missing or unknown key is `unauthorized` (401); a known key without
+permission is `forbidden` (403).
+
+## Audit
+
+Every non-GET request made with a known key adds an entry
+`{ at, key, method, path, status }`. `GET /audit` lists them, newest first.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
